      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having this issue now. It was not a thing before VRChat 2019.2.5 update AND SteamVR 1.6.10 update. Might be SteamVR issue after all.\nFrom SteamVR changelog:\n- If a trigger has a value of 0.2 or higher, the “touched” bit will be set for that trigger.\n\nCan it be an issue?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
